{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c0f0c8813795292191e1a41b984195e091c338a388d1cddbdfddd6d106b37d40", "ja": "（『4 Luxury』の活動は順調に続いている……\n今日は、麗花メインの新企画の打ち合わせをしてきた）", "zh": "（『4 Luxury』的活动顺利进行着……今天开了个关于以丽花为主的新企划的会）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "e8196c85a4dd1c60c43ecc143f49d40f9561e0bbc9d1fff0ea6bcb6a7a255342", "ja": "{$P$}さん、このあと\n時間ありますか？　少しより道したいんですけど。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，等下有空吗？我想顺路去个地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "327c756c0ad58607bc19e65062b95236362c936a8749599c84cbda1fcaba44b0", "ja": "この近くの特設会場に、すっごいのが\nできたらしくて！　超巨大って噂なんです！", "zh": "听说这附近的临时会场里，好像建成了一个超厉害的东西！据说超级巨大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1003_p", "source_sha256": "55fb9fb1f80c4e34821bf00c0522d23329f323df4c7a05074b57a2147f4a43bd", "ja": "え？　少しくらいならいいけど……。\nすっごいとか超巨大って、なんの話だ？", "zh": "诶？稍微去看一下倒是没问题……不过“厉害的”和“超巨大”到底是在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "b85add533e504d31a8cb1d07ca2a41bc8a2411729c41b371b9dbab5858a9b9ab", "ja": "ジャングルジムですよ。超巨大ってどのくらいの\n大きさなんでしょう？　乗鞍岳くらいかな？", "zh": "是攀爬架哦。所谓的超巨大，究竟会有多大呢？大概有乘鞍岳那么大？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "206beafdb283d67ec2948dd60087e5099d44c7ef034d7d41858b5875218d2562", "ja": "そんな標高が気になるサイズだと大変だが……。\nっていうか、どうして急にジャングルジムに？", "zh": "要是大到得在意海拔，那可就不得了了……话说回来，怎么突然提到攀爬架了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "ec8a8b3c0df3b647014d5a33355e3b6863bd1af32ce738abe36be4a0e2c460c1", "ja": "さっきの打ち合わせで『セレブレーション！』の\nドラマの話を、みんなでしてたじゃないですか。", "zh": "刚才开会的时候，大家不是一起聊过《Celebration！》的剧情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "f774741c1717d813ad7f7daaabb35d4f1185a502cc7a6a0babccc43e549a6000", "ja": "それで私、ジャングルジムのことを\n思い出しちゃって……えへへ♪", "zh": "所以我就想起了攀爬架……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1008_p", "source_sha256": "617b889238bd06ad69cf6f4ddf93f8ff88680c6a4ae37a4dbfd7136836c36b07", "ja": "なるほど。\n仕事上がりに行くにはハードそうな……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n对工作结束后去那里来说，似乎有点够呛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "0536785e31d09af3fe3eaf66e50a4d8dc3f18095326559aac6e9ceba1596d3c1", "ja": "運動不足解消にピッタリですよ。\n一緒に登りましょう♪　レッツゴー！", "zh": "非常适合用来消除运动不足哦。\n一起爬吧♪　出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8f39f54a6c79d71650a89ad479c3df28c56516e1b2d6d63a96ccf80a7ea633e9", "ja": "えっ、俺も一緒に？\n今スーツだし、それはちょっと……！", "zh": "诶，我也要一起？  \n我现在还穿着西装，这就有点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "13d79d83c528e73acb3ba31b7cd66c725368ca49789c9855142378d34d59ec0f", "ja": "じゃあ、着替えてから……あ、もしかしたら\n会場で、ジャージ借りられたりしませんか？", "zh": "那换好衣服之后……啊，说不定\n会场那边能借到运动服吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cbc1a24879672c7e4d17eed87c9001a8a845f7f73d82b84e6ee193b8733cb634", "ja": "いやその……あ、待てよ。こっちも\nジャングルと聞いて、思い出したんだが……。", "zh": "不是，我是说……啊，等等。听到“丛林”这个词，我也想起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d69be66e39d7458745a91542749c93b2b9a5906cb7bd2352d489659dfe4c8627", "ja": "麗花の部屋、またジャングルみたいに\nなってるって、メンバーから聞いたぞ！", "zh": "听成员们说，丽花的房间又变得像丛林一样了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "ea5f6b074447a707fc37e448717c313059d10b77f61a9307b21f09ec94705f0a", "ja": "あっ！　実はそうなんですよ！\nそろそろ、またお部屋を片付けないと……。", "zh": "啊！其实确实是那样呢！\n差不多又该收拾一下房间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "45bca3d0c038b263ccf92e98eb4c62f8101faa1ee0c25c483c18f51e2a24fc10", "ja": "このまま散らかっていくと、いつかでんでんむす君\nあたりが遭難しちゃうかもしれません。大変！", "zh": "要是继续这样乱下去，说不定哪天连电电姆斯君之类的都会迷路呢。那可就糟糕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3f26a87e2aad3b52c324889cbefb2726350b13fe731e5592db8682f9ef579a4e", "ja": "でんでん……人形か何かか？\nともかく、大変なことになる前になんとかしよう。", "zh": "电电……是玩偶之类的吗？\n总之，得在事情变得严重之前想办法解决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "3ff68fe7a0bbda5100f305f0029f5c361171caa83d31417dabb1dc9ef359e4a1", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます♪　じゃあ今日は、\nうちのジャングルの探検ですね。", "zh": "哇，太谢谢您了♪　那今天\n就去探索我家的丛林吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1018_p", "source_sha256": "96709d04fa0de4435e81f43f68a928d9b89d1c97d68373e492727038179a7b81", "ja": "そうだな……よし、助けも呼ぶか！\n風花に歌織さん、このみさん、それに莉緒も。", "zh": "是啊……好，那就也叫上帮手吧！\n风花、歌织、木实，还有莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "cb94c95e2fa0e2007d522cf6071a8b869ece74cb717181d57a8d2f2f92c99ad9", "ja": "わーいわーい！　秘境探検隊、結成ですね♪\nみんなと一緒なら、きっと大丈夫です！", "zh": "好耶好耶！秘境探险队成立了呢♪\n只要和大家在一起，就一定没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0213_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "cc72d45ce36d398110e4e50d564f77991c00ac45268c66b7576009f058939d0d", "ja": "ピッケルとか安全靴は、私が貸しますね！\nえ～っと……、どこにあったかな～？", "zh": "冰镐之类的，还有安全鞋，我可以借给你们！\n呃～……放在哪里来着～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
